# ── NEXUS COLD STORAGE POLICY — CONFIDENTIAL IP ──────────────────────
# These directories contain NEXUS proprietary data, model weights,
# research artifacts, and training datasets. They MUST NOT be committed
# to any public or private Git repository. Backups go to D:\NEXUS_COLD.
#
# Rationale:
#   /datasets/    — Training/evaluation datasets (stress lab, TAMAS, v1-v6)
#   /models/      — Model weights, GGUF, safetensors, adapters (26+ GB)
#   /research/    — Raw research papers, red-team material, DERDDRE sources
#   /benchmarks/  — Generated benchmark datasets, evaluation outputs
#   /logs/        — Runtime logs, forensics, audit trails
#   /backups/     — Local backup snapshots
#   /upload/      — Uploaded files from external teams (may contain secrets)
#   /vault/       — Encrypted secrets, API keys, credentials
#
# Backup command: python scripts/cold_storage_backup.py
# Restore command: python scripts/cold_storage_restore.py
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
/datasets/
/models/
/research/
/benchmarks/
/logs/
/backups/
/upload/
/vault/

